      "title": "Graduate Studies",
      "description": "Graduate Studies | Adrian College | Liberal Arts College in MI Skip to main content Skip to footer Bulldog 101 September 19th - Register Now! Close Search submit Explore Adrian College Why Adrian? Whatever your background, Adrian College can provide you with the skills and experience you need to realize your dreams. Undergraduate Studies We offer an undergraduate program of study that’s small enough to be personal Graduate Studies Pursuing your dream career starts with the next phase of your education. When you enroll in graduate school at Adrian College, you’re beginning more than advanced training in your field; you’re accelerating your professional journey. Apply Visit Request Info Find a Program Give Today Close Menu Apply Visit Request Info Find a Program Give Today Main Menu About Academics Admissions Athletics Financial Aid Student Life Student Info Admitted Students Future Students International Students MyAdrian Transfer Students Info For Alumni Conferences Development Contact Us 110 S Madison Street Adrian, MI 49221 Phone: (517) 265-5161 Email: Get in Touch Apply Visit Request Info Find a Program Give Today Explore More Academic Calendar Campus Map Directory Event Calendar Library News Photo Albums Search Menu Search Menu Graduate Studies Home Admissions Graduate Studies Share In This Section Graduate Studies Overview How to Apply Programs Professional Development Tuition & Aid Leadership News Resources Contact Apply Visit Request Info Give Today Pursuing your dream career starts with the next phase of your education. When you enroll in graduate school at Adrian College, you’re beginning more than advanced training in your field; you’re accelerating your professional journey. Explore all that Adrian College has to offer and earn your master’s degree from an institution rich in history yet nationally recognized as a \"School to Watch\" by US News & World Report. Get started today. Impact the world tomorrow. Apply Online Quick Facts 18 Specialized Master's Programs $680 Fee per Credit Hour for Graduate Students 95% of AC Master's Graduates Employed in their Chosen Field In This Section Programs Graduate courses you can take at Adrian College Professional Development Beyond the coursework, research, and presentations, your graduate experience will aid in your growth and professional development. Through programs and events, the Graduate Studies faculty will help you identify potential areas for growth and develop skills in those areas, all while planning your next career move with a competitive advantage. Tuition & Aid The tuition, fees, and charges for graduate programs are subject to change. Typically, fees are approved in the summer for the following academic year. Please contact the Cashier’s Office for more information. News Check out what our Graduate Studies Program has been up to Resources Helpful links for Graduate Students Contact For any questions, please do not hesitate to reach out. How to Apply At Adrian College, we make it easy to continue your education today so you can impact the world tomorrow. Get started! Leadership Developing Programs That Help You Impact the World Your browser doesn't support HTML5 video. Get Started Begin your journey at Adrian College Apply Visit Request Info Find a Program Give Today Contact 110 S Madison Street Adrian, MI 49221 (517) 265-5161 Contact Us About Overview Business Office Campus & Facilities Human Resources Institutional Research Leadership Marketing & Public Relations National Call to Action Our Story & History Ribbons of Excellence Student Life Overview Campus & Community Health, Safety & Support Living on Campus Media & Communications Student Services & Resources Title IX Info For Alumni Conferences Development Academics Overview Academic Calendar Academic Concern/Complaint Academic Services Career Planning Continuing Education Find a Program Graduate Catalog Graduate Programs Honors Program Innovation Adrian Institutes & Directorships Insti